  $ pd tunnel --help || true
  You're in a session: session-<ID> — "Backfill search index"
    pd note "progress"     Log what you're doing
    pd done "summary"      Wrap it up

  Get started:
    pd setup                  [notify] Install daemon, MCP, FleetBar, init project
    pd begin "purpose"       [notify] I'll set up your agent + session
    pd done "summary"        [notify] Finish up — I'll clean everything
    pd whoami                [silent] See your current context
    pd attention             [notify] What other agents queued for you (run first thing!)

  Ports:
    pd claim <id>            [notify] I'll assign a port  (c)
    pd release <id>          [notify] Free it up  (r)  (--expired is destructive)
    pd find [pattern]        [silent] What's running  (f, l, ps)

  Sessions & notes:
    pd session start "why"   [notify] Manual session start

  $ pd status
  Port Daddy is running
    Version: 3.17.1 (<HASH>)
    PID <PID>
    Uptime: <UPTIME>
    Active ports: 3
    Runtime: nominal
    Fleet: 0 project(s), 0 agent(s)
    Bosun: idle — daemon heartbeat writer active; pd-bosun supervisor not installed (optional)
    Last activity: <AGE> ago
